  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w19.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w19.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "建て替えの下見が、受付の壁まで来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "趣意書の額——始まりの言葉を納めた、あの古い額も外すことになる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大工さんが二人がかりで持ち上げて、「おっ」と声を出した。……裏に、もう一枚、紙がある。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "額の裏に紙の跡があるのは、去年から分かっていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "中身は、誰も知らなかった。大工さんが慎重に剥がして、私の手に載せる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "埃と、古い墨の匂い。古い、古い、手紙だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "読み上げる声が、途中で小さくなった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「——今夜、柿落としが終わった。皆が帰った。四百年で、いちばん良い夜だった」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……日付は、四百年前。この闘技場の、最初の夜だった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "続きは、こうだった。「終わらせたく、なかった」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「だから、同じ一年を、もう一度だけ、と書いた」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「もう一度だけ、もう一度だけ、と書いているうちに——」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……やめ方が、分からなくなった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "巻き戻る暦、同じ進行の祭り。続きの無い、続き。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年の「もう一度だけ」の正体が、手のひらの上にあった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "悪意では、なかったんだ。宿題を、四百年、出しそびれた人みたいだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……終わらせたくなかった誰かの、やめられなくなった、大事のしかただった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "仲間が、そっと覗き込んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……誰が、書いたんです?」手紙を、裏まで返す——文字は、日付と本文だけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……署名だけが、無いんだ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年、続きを書いてきた誰かは、自分の名前だけ、書かなかった。書き忘れたのか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "書けなかったのか。それとも——書く資格が無いと、思ったのか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、少し、しゅんと下がった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w19.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "額は、元の壁に戻した。手紙は写しを取り、原本は祝いの帳面に、そっと挟んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "始まりの言葉の裏で、四百年待っていた手紙。祝いの日に、ちゃんと返したい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……誰に返すのかは、まだ分からないけれど。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その晩、名簿と手紙を、机に並べて気づいた。私はいま、名前を百、集めている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あの人は四百年、名前を一つ書けずにいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w19.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……どちらも、たった一つの名前の話なんだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w19.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
